{"id":"88f2e369d1e1537f","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-dominating-number-nd.md","title":"Dominating Number","display":"df-dominating-number-nd — Dominating Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dominating-number-nd","aliases":["58-df-dominating-number-nd"],"display":"df-dominating-number-nd — Dominating Number","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dominating-number-nd"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dominating-number-nd</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dominating-number-nd — Dominating Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c576036cb4f9664\" href=\"?note=7c576036cb4f9664\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md\">../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq^*\">\\(\\leq^*\\)</span> is eventual domination on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\,{}^\\omega\\omega\">\\(\\,{}^\\omega\\omega\\)</span> as fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c576036cb4f9664\" href=\"?note=7c576036cb4f9664\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md\">../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}number\\text{-}nd}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|D|:\nD\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in D\\;(f\\leq^*g)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}number\\text{-}nd}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|D|:\nD\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in D\\;(f\\leq^*g)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus the unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> satisfying this predicate is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak d\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The file is an alias-level atom for the dominating-number clause of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c576036cb4f9664\" href=\"?note=7c576036cb4f9664\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md\">../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md</a>, not a second incompatible definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md","status":"resolved","id":"7c576036cb4f9664","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md","status":"resolved","id":"7c576036cb4f9664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in V$ and $\\leq^*$ is eventual domination on $\\,{}^\\omega\\omega$ as fixed in [[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md","status":"resolved","id":"7c576036cb4f9664","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The file is an alias-level atom for the dominating-number clause of [[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]], not a second incompatible definition.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\,{}^\\omega\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}number\\text{-}nd}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa=\n\\min\\left\\{|D|:\nD\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\n\\forall f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in D\\;(f\\leq^*g)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak d","display":false}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-452","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dominating-number-nd.md|58-df-dominating-number-nd]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["7c576036cb4f9664"]}